# Naming & File Structure Rules

## File Naming Convention

| Tip | Format | Nümunə |
|---|---|---|
| Component | PascalCase | CourseCard.tsx |
| Page component | PascalCase + Page | BootcampPage.tsx |
| Hook | camelCase + use | useCourses.ts |
| API file | kebab + .api | bootcamp.api.ts |
| Query keys | kebab + .keys | bootcamp.keys.ts |
| Types | kebab + .types | bootcamp.types.ts |
| Zod schema | kebab + .schema | bootcamp.schema.ts |
| Zustand store | kebab + .store | auth.store.ts |
| Selectors | kebab + .selectors | auth.selectors.ts |
| Constants | kebab + .constants | auth.constants.ts |
| Utils | kebab + .utils | token.utils.ts |

## Module Structure Template

Every module follows this IDENTICAL structure:

modules/<module-name>/
├── api/
│   ├── <module>.api.ts       ← axios functions
│   ├── <module>.keys.ts      ← queryKey factory
│   ├── use<Entity>.ts        ← useQuery hooks
│   └── use<Action>.ts        ← useMutation hooks
├── components/
│   ├── <ComponentName>.tsx
│   └── index.ts
├── pages/
│   └── <Module>Page.tsx
├── store/                    ← only if module needs global state
│   ├── <module>.store.ts
│   └── <module>.selectors.ts
├── hooks/                    ← non-query hooks only
│   └── use<Something>.ts
├── types/
│   ├── <module>.types.ts     ← TypeScript interfaces
│   └── <module>.schema.ts    ← Zod validation schemas
├── utils/
│   └── <module>.helpers.ts
├── constants/
│   └── <module>.constants.ts
└── index.ts                  ← PUBLIC API only

## index.ts — Public API Rules

// ✅ index.ts — yalnız xarici istifadə üçün olanlar export edilir
export { CourseCard } from './components/CourseCard'
export { useCourses } from './api/useCourses'
export { useEnroll } from './api/useEnroll'
export type { Course, CourseFilters } from './types/bootcamp.types'

// ❌ Internal helpers xaricə export edilmir
// export { calculateProgress } from './utils/bootcamp.helpers'

## Route Constants

// ✅ Always use ROUTES constant
import { ROUTES } from '@/shared/constants/routes'
navigate(ROUTES.BOOTCAMP.DETAIL.replace(':id', courseId))

// ❌ Never hardcode
navigate('/bootcamp/123')

## i18n Namespace Convention

const { t } = useTranslation('bootcamp')  // modules/bootcamp
const { t } = useTranslation('auth')      // modules/auth
const { t } = useTranslation('common')    // shared